<https://w3id.org/aias#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A construct of this work, equated with the technical resource of VDI 3682: a resource is what performs a function, which is what that standard defines the technical resource as.\r\n\r\nThe kinds of resource below are the devices of a plant. They come from no standard and can be refined further through a classification of equipment such as ECLASS."@en .
