<https://w3id.org/aias#InternalCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Flexibel skalierbare Rechenressourcen innerhalb des Anlagen- oder Unternehmensnetzes."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Component> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#InternalCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Flexibly scalable computing resources inside the plant or company network."@en .
_:N76f3d7a4eab04714897f46a26675e566 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses> .
<https://w3id.org/aias> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Nothing here is normative. The three patterns rest on standards, this ontology rests on design decisions of the work.\r\n\r\nThree subdomains are joined: the technical process after VDI 3682, the communication after ISO/IEC 7498-1, and the AI after ISO/IEC 22989.\r\n\r\nScope: the three patterns named above and the classes that tie them together. The payload of a transmission is equated with a dataset rather than kept apart from it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Alexander Fay" .
<https://w3id.org/aias#ExternalCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Flexibly scalable computing resources outside the plant or company network, reaching which typically requires an external network such as an internet connection."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> .
_:Nf9835048b92c42fdb263c59e6cfe9a5f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Sensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sensor"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasInputCommunication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias#Component> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#hasFlow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat Fluss"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Actuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Devices intervening physically in the technical process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias#Function> .
<https://w3id.org/aias#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a function or a component to the assignment stating which resource carries out which function."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias#Relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Beschreibt strukturierte Beziehungen und Abhängigkeiten zwischen Funktionen und Komponenten."@de .
